            "review_title": "Review at Cai Gi Do Vegan Food Cafe Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David S\nIncheon, South Korea7 contributions\n0\nMisleading\nFeb 2017 • Friends\nI'm very hesitant to give bad reviews but this place did not live up to my expectations. The Food was fresh and the servers were kind. It's a self proclaimed vegan restaurant but had a lot of meat on the menu. We ordered the Egg Noodle with Seafood and it was great. We also ordered vegetable spring rolls and there was chicken in them. We ordered the palmelo salad with prawns and fish sauce after seeing the colourful picture in the menu. What we got was romain lettuce, with bits of bland palmelo but at least the shrimp/prawns were fresh. We were the only patrons in here and the service was really slow. Our server was kind but seamed very inexperienced. This place had a god atmosphere and what looks like a good menu but seams like it can do much better.\nRead more\nWritten February 2, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
