            "review_title": "Review at Cai Gi Do Vegan Food Cafe Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Chelsea M\n10 contributions\n0\nAmazing vegan food and great service\nNov 2016 • Solo\nNot only was the food incredible, but the service was excellent as well. I was lucky enough to find this restaurant on my first day in Saigon and was so impressed that I went back the next night. I have a nut allergy and am vegetarian and the server's were happy to help me choose something I could eat. Even as a solo traveller the atmosphere is fantastic and the drinks even better. I'm not sure exactly what i was expecting when I ordered a blueberry lemon tea mocktail, but what I received was was possibly one of the most amazing things I've ever tasted. If you go I would definitely recommend giving it a try.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2016",
